From: Jason Elie Bou Kheir <5115126+jasonboukheir@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:25:15 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Port the in-process SYCL extensible cache to the Inkling core

Backport the XPU config and virtual-memory driver from b18eee6e90c77a08b05d687cc9b47ebdd08cfc3e. Route the allocator-limit update through the device module used by this worker. Use only in-process connectors, and require an explicit request on XPU.

Signed-off-by: Jason Elie Bou Kheir <5115126+jasonboukheir@users.noreply.github.com>
